  >>> tf.math.exp(x)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2,), dtype=float32,
  numpy=array([   7.389056, 2980.958   ], dtype=float32)>

  For complex numbers, the exponential value is calculated as
  $$
  e^{x+iy} = {e^x} {e^{iy}} = {e^x} ({\cos (y) + i \sin (y)})
